---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { Picture } from 'astro:assets';
import profilePicture from '../assets/images/resume/thamara.png';

const pageTitle = "Resume - Thamara Kandabada";
const slashpageImage = "/featured-images/resume.png";
---
<PageLayout title={pageTitle} image={slashpageImage}>
 <div class="h-resume">
    <h1>Résumé</h1>
    
    <div class="resume-header p-contact h-card">
      <div class="resume-photo">
        <Picture
          class="u-photo"
          src={profilePicture} alt="Profile photo of Thamara Kandabada"
          formats={['avif', 'webp']}
        />
      </div>
      <div class="resume-details">
        <h2 class="p-name">Thamara Kandabada</h2>
        <p class="p-summary">I am a Sri Lankan professional currently living and working in Belfast, Northern Ireland. I have a keen eye for detail and a strong work ethic. I pride myself in my ability to adapt and learn new things—be it technology, operational processes, or creative endeavours. In my free time, I frequent the cinema, play guitar, game, read, and tinker with this website.</p>
        <div class="resume-contact">
          <p><a class="u-email" href="mailto:t@thamara.co.uk"><i class="bi bi-envelope"></i> Email</a></p>
          <p><a class="u-url" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/thamarakandabada/"><i class="bi bi-linkedin"></i> LinkedIn</a></p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="resume-heading">At a glance</h3>
    <div class="resume-timeline">
      <div class="resume-2017">
        <h3>2017</h3>
        <p>Left my job in marketing to start my own business. Built a very successful e-commerce business over the next 5+ years.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="resume-2020">
        <h3>2020</h3>
        <p>Started a manufacturing arm for the business. Developed key skills in the apparel manufacturing sector.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="resume-2022">
        <h3>2022</h3>
        <p>Moved to Belfast to support my partner with her further education plans. Started working at <a href="https://deskwarehouse.co.uk/" target="_blank">Desk Warehouse</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="resume-glance">
      <div>
      <h3>Key skills & qualities</h3>
      <ul>
        <li class="p-skill">A keen eye for detail</li>
        <li class="p-skill">A strong work ethic</li>
        <li class="p-skill">The ability to adapt quickly</li>
        <li class="p-skill">A lifelong love of learning</li>
        <li class="p-skill">A creative brain</li>
      </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
      <h3>Hobbies & interests</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Avid cinema-goer and physical media collector</li>
        <li>Blues and rock aficionado</li>
        <li>Bedroom guitar player</li>
        <li>Amateur gamer</li>
        <li>Alternate movie poster designer</li>
        <li><a href="/now">More on my now page</a></li>
      </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
      <h3>Professional & personal milestones</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Co-founding and managing two successful businesses early in life</li>
        <li>Moving across continents with my partner with our lives packed into a few bags and starting anew as migrants </li>
      </ul>
      </div>
      <div>
      <h3>Networks</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>BNI (<a href="https://business-ni.com/northern-ireland-invictus/en-GB/index" target="_blank">Invictus Chapter</a>)</li>
      </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="resume-heading">Experience</h3>
    <div class="resume-experience">
      <h4>Desk Warehouse | Belfast, UK <span class="current">current</span></h4>
      <p>Desk Warehouse is the leading office furniture supplier in Northern Ireland. Our showrooms are based in a large converted Victorian linen mill, and we have an extensive selection of new, clearance and used office furniture to suit any requirement.</p>
      <div class="resume-experience-role h-event p-experience">
        <span class="p-org" hidden>Desk Warehouse</span>
        <div>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title p-name">General Manager</p>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title-duration"><time class="dt-start" datetime="2024-02">Feb 2024</time>–Present</p>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-experience-role-description p-description">
          <p>While making sure all aspects of the day-to-day run smoothly, I also take primary responsibility for the sales pipeline of the business.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="resume-experience-role h-event p-experience">
                <span class="p-org" hidden>Desk Warehouse</span>
        <div>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title p-name">Admin Manager</p>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title-duration"><time class="dt-start" datetime="2022-11">Nov 2022</time>–<time class="dt-end" datetime="2024-02">Feb 2024</time></p>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-experience-role-description p-description">
          <p>Daily admin tasks including showroom operations, online/offline sales support, order processing, delivery route planning, customer support, credit control and marketing content creation.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h4>Bear Appeal & Bear Supply Global | Nugegoda, Sri Lanka</h4>
      <p>Bear Appeal is a men’s clothing brand that is all about convenience and peace-of-mind. Offering high quality everyday wear that help you get through your day, Bear Appeal boasts an extremely loyal customer base, which continues to expand thanks to a tried and tested customer-centric formula. In 2022, Bear Appeal expanded into the Maldives market.</p>
      <p>Bear Supply Global is an apparel manufacturing company, primarily founded as the production arm for the Bear Appeal brand. Since then, Bear Supply Global has expanded operations to service other clients such as Uber Sri Lanka, 99x Technology, Calcey Technologies, CodeGen International, Surge Global, and more.</p>
      <div class="resume-experience-role h-event p-experience">
        <span class="p-org" hidden>Bear Appeal & Bear Supply Global</span>
        <div>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title p-name">Co-Founder & Director</p>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title-duration"><time class="dt-start" datetime="2017-04">Apr 2017</time>–<time class="dt-end" datetime="2022-09">Sept 2022</time></p>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-experience-role-description p-description">
          <p>Primary responsibilities:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>One of the key decision makers for the company regarding all matters</li>
              <li>Corporate account management</li>
              <li>Production floor supervision</li>
              <li>General administration</li>
              <li>Supervision of all day-to-day operations including order management, fulfilment, customer service, inventory management, supply chain and finances</li>
              <li>Team building, coaching and training</li>
              <li>Representing the company at industry events and in the media</li>
            </ul>
          <p>Notable achievements:</p>
            <ul>
              <li>Cutting down production lead time by more than half (compared to outsourced manufacturing)</li>
              <li>Maintaining low production costs, enabling us to keep Bear Appeal products affordable through the pandemic and an economic crisis</li>
              <li>Creating a fully bootstrapped profit-making startup with no external funding</li>
              <li>Offering exceptional customer service and great products (Rated 4.9/5 on Google with 1000+ reviews)</li>
              <li>Growing sales and new customer acquisitions through a pandemic</li>
              <li>Excellent customer retention and loyalty throughout the years</li>
              <li>Offering a lenient refund/exchange policy to all customers</li>
            </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h4>Sana Commerce | Colombo, Sri Lanka</h4>
      <p>Sana Commerce is a class leading B2B e-commerce solution that helps companies sell their products online while keeping their ERP system at the heart of everything. I primarily explored opportunities in Australia & New Zealand.</p>
      <div class="resume-experience-role h-event p-experience">
        <span class="p-org" hidden>Sana Commerce</span>
        <div>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title p-name">Field Marketing Manager</p>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title-duration"><time class="dt-start" datetime="2016-04">Apr 2016</time>–<time class="dt-end" datetime="2017-05">May 2017</time></p>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-experience-role-description p-description">
          <p>Primary responsibilities:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Designing and executing campaigns for brand awareness and demand generation, especially in Australia and New Zealand</li>
            <li>Email marketing (using Marketo)</li>
            <li>Social Media marketing (primarily LinkedIn Advertising)</li>
            <li>Web Advertising and PR (with external partners)</li>
            <li>SEA and SEM (with external technical partners)</li>
            <li>Event marketing (primarily SAP and MS Dynamics related)</li>
            <li>Acting in an advisory capacity to the Database Marketing team which I managed earlier</li>
            <li>Overseeing the regional business development (cold calling) team in close collaboration with the regional Sales Manager</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Notable achievements:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Maintaining a 35%+ QoQ increase in incoming qualified leads for the sales team to engage (2016)</li>
            <li>Introducing CamCard to the sales and marketing teams in order to streamline the process of collecting, recording and following up business cards (I prepared documentation and conducted one-on-one sessions to onboard colleagues)</li>
            <li>Close cooperation with Sales, Product Dev and Upper Management to develop effective campaigns that aligned with broader company goals</li>
            <li>Special focus in Sales and Marketing alignment</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="resume-experience-role h-event p-experience">
                <span class="p-org" hidden>Sana Commerce</span>
        <div>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title p-name">Database Marketing Manager</p>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title-duration"><time class="dt-start" datetime="2015-10">Oct 2015</time>–<time class="dt-end" datetime="2016-04">Apr 2016</time></p>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-experience-role-description p-description">
          <p>Primary responsibilities:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Heading the team which was responsible for managing and effectively distributing all inbound lead-related data that gets captured in the company’s CRM and Marketing Automation (Marketo) systems on to the sales team</li>
            <li>Liaising with the Digital Marketing and lead generation teams to optimise processes of lead generation, lead nurturing and data enrichment, while providing the international Sales team the best data to work with.</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Notable achievements:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Introducing and onboarding (by creating and conducting tutorials, documentation, videos, support material and one-on-one sessions) the international marketing team spread across 3 continents to the task management platform Trello.</li>
            <li>Training a member of my team to take on the team leadership role</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="resume-experience-role h-event p-experience">
                <span class="p-org" hidden>Sana Commerce</span>
        <div>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title p-name">Team Captain – Marketing Support</p>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title-duration"><time class="dt-start" datetime="2015-08">Aug 2015</time>–<time class="dt-end" datetime="2015-10">Oct 2015</time></p>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-experience-role-description p-description">
          <p>Primary responsibilities:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Conducting market research</li>
            <li>Supporting the International social media marketing team</li>
            <li>Formulating and implementing the online content strategy of the Sri Lankan operation (social media and website content)</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Notable achievements:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Producing a weekly video content programme which featured employees as the ambassadors of the company</li>
            <li>Co-ordinating the Great Place to Work 2015 programme for the company</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="resume-experience-role h-event p-experience">
                <span class="p-org" hidden>Sana Commerce</span>
        <div>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title p-name">Junior Business Developer </p>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title-duration"><time class="dt-start" datetime="2015-01">Jan 2015</time>–<time class="dt-end" datetime="2015-08">Aug 2015</time></p>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-experience-role-description p-description">
          <p>Primary responsibilities:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Data entry and enrichment</li>
            <li>Lead generation via social media prospecting</li>
            <li>Market research and analysis</li>
          </ul>
          <p>Notable achievements:</p>
          <ul>
            <li>Training new colleagues for the data entry team</li>
            <li>Actively contributing to making a fully-fledged business development centre with separate teams for sales, marketing support, and lead generation</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h4>eBEYONDS | Pannipitiya, Sri Lanka</h4>
      <div class="resume-experience-role h-event p-experience">
                <span class="p-org" hidden>eBEYONDS</span>
        <div>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title p-name">Intern</p>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title-duration"><time class="dt-start" datetime="2014-12">Dec 2014</time>–<time class="dt-end" datetime="2015-01">Jan 2015</time></p>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-experience-role-description p-description">
          <p>I worked briefly in the company as a trainee where I mainly supported the organising of a soft skills training programme. PACE Institute, the educational arm of eBEYONDS, organised this event focused on filling the much needed gap in the academic and professional education industry to mould and build a high value employee.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h4>UNICEF | Remote</h4>
      <div class="resume-experience-role h-event p-experience">
                        <span class="p-org" hidden>UNICEF</span>

        <div>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title p-name">Blogging Intern</p>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title-duration"><time class="dt-start" datetime="2014-06">Jun 2014</time>–<time class="dt-end" datetime="2015-01">Jan 2015</time></p>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-experience-role-description p-description">
          <p>I was selected as one of the 20 blogging interns from around the world for Voices of Youth remote internship programme in 2014. During the 6-month internship, passionate youngsters from around the world published articles regularly on a range of youth and development related topics.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <h4>Sri Lanka Anti-Narcotics Association | Colombo, Sri Lanka</h4>
      <div class="resume-experience-role h-event p-experience">
            <span class="p-org" hidden>Sri Lanka Anti-Narcotics Association</span>
        <div>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title p-name">Intern</p>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title-duration"><time class="dt-start" datetime="2014-05">May 2014</time>–<time class="dt-end" datetime="2014-08">Aug 2014</time></p>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-experience-role-description p-description">
          <p>I worked as a project official for the 16th National Health Run (2014), the annual national awareness event organised by SLANA. I also helped in organising and conducting two other community-based awareness projects for schoolchildren, labourers, and vulnerable communal groups.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <h3 class="resume-heading">Education</h3>
    <div class="resume-experience">
    <h4>Chartered Institute of Management Accountants</h4>
      <div class="resume-experience-role h-event p-education">
          <span class="p-org" hidden>Chartered Institute of Management Accountants</span>
        <div>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title p-name">CIMA Professional Qualification</p>
          <p class="resume-experience-role-title-duration"><time class="dt-start" datetime="2013-09">Sept 2013</time>–<time class="dt-end" datetime="2015-05">May 2015</time></p>
        </div>
        <div class="resume-experience-role-description p-description">
          <p>Management Accounting qualification with a focus on business strategy and financial performance.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      </div>


    <h3 class="resume-heading">Recommendations</h3>
    <div class="resume-recs">
      <div class="recommendation">
        <p class="rec-text">“Thamara joined Sana as one of the first members of the business development team in Sri Lanka. He more than successfully carried out all the responsibilities in this role while directly being involved in recruiting for and growing the team further. Next to that he took on the challenge of building the marketing support function in Sri Lanka and went on to manage the marketing activities for the APAC and Middle East regions for the Sana product. Overall, I’ve come to know Thamara as someone who likes challenges and is keen to grab opportunities. He’s entrepreneurial, a great communicator and simply very pleasant to work with.”</p>
        <p class="rec-person">Michiel Schipperus <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/michielschipperus/" target="_blank"><i class="bi bi-linkedin"></i></a></p>
        <p class="rec-person-title">Former CEO, Sana Commerce</p>
      </div>
      <div class="recommendation">
        <p class="rec-text">“I worked with Thamara when I was managing the Business Development Department at Sana Commerce. Thamara proved to be a very bright and ambitious person, with a clear drive to continuously improve himself, both personally and professionally. Thanks to his contribution we saw a boost in the efficiency of the Marketing support team in Sri Lanka and we managed to structure the first marketing campaigns for the Business Development Department.”</p>
        <p class="rec-person">Francesco Redolfi <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/francesco-redolfi/" target="_blank"><i class="bi bi-linkedin"></i></a></p>
        <p class="rec-person-title">Former Business Development Manager, Sana Commerce</p>
      </div>
      <div class="recommendation">
        <p class="rec-text">“Thamara has a great intrinsic ambitious drive. With his curious mind and early adoption of new technologies he is a great asset for any organisation.”</p>
        <p class="rec-person">Alexander van Ooijen <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/vanooijen/" target="_blank"><i class="bi bi-linkedin"></i></a></p>
        <p class="rec-person-title">Former General Manager, Sana Commerce Sri Lanka</p>
      </div>
      <div class="recommendation">
        <p class="rec-text">“Thamara is very enthusiastic and pro-active. He is a result driven individual with a lot of dedication to marketing management activities for Sana Commerce in Asia Pacific & Middle East. I really enjoy working with Thamara.”</p>
        <p class="rec-person">Arjuna Hettiarachchi <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/ahettiarachchi/" target="_blank"><i class="bi bi-linkedin"></i></a></p>
        <p class="rec-person-title">Former Sales Manager, Sana Commerce Sri Lanka</p>
      </div>
      <div class="recommendation">
        <p class="rec-text">“Thamara is a very methodical committed person who can be given key responsibilities. I would not hesitate to recommend Thamara to any organisation that requires the services of an efficient young man.”</p>
        <p class="rec-person">Sajith De Silva <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/sajithdesilva/" target="_blank"><i class="bi bi-linkedin"></i></a></p>
        <p class="rec-person-title">CEO, eBEYONDS</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

</PageLayout>